WEBVTT

00:15:28.371 --> 00:15:32.412
And please, if it's helpful, think of the
Zig-Zag project as your neutral zone,

00:15:32.537 --> 00:15:35.537
your place to sit with all
the ideas and yes.

00:15:35.537 --> 00:15:39.996
Emotions that are going to come up. Which
brings us to your first mission.

00:15:40.454 --> 00:15:41.662
Should you choose to accept it,

00:15:47.079 --> 00:15:48.912
you are going to take your own pulse,

00:15:49.246 --> 00:15:54.371
survey yourself and observe where you are
right now before even trying to figure

00:15:54.371 --> 00:15:57.621
out where you're going. Don't think
about your next career move

00:15:57.621 --> 00:16:01.746
or try to pin down your ambitions.
Just be with your brain.